              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ari ku mpfiro, abakirizi baravuga bati: “Ntiwihebure; uvyaye umuhungu.” Ariko ntiyagira ico yishura canke ngo anavyiteho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.4.20",
