        {
          "text": "Yita uwo muhungu Ikabodi, risigura ngo: “Icubahiro kivuye kuri Isirayeli,” kuko bafashe Isandugu y’Imana kandi sebukwe n’umugabo wiwe bakaba bapfuye. ",
